WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.326
Danny: Here goes nothing!

2
00:00:18.327 --> 00:00:26.007
Tina: Maybe the lights are a good sign!

3
00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:30.053
Brad: Maybe this will be the right world!

4
00:00:30.054 --> 00:00:36.566
Danny: We’re about to find out.

5
00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:41.758
Brad: Um . . . So this doesn’t look good.

6
00:00:41.759 --> 00:00:44.799
Danny: Follow me! Ow!

7
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.446
Tina: What?

8
00:00:46.447 --> 00:00:50.669
Danny: I just bumped into a rock.

9
00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:57.885
Brad: Ha-ha. Oh man, I wish I had seen that.

10
00:00:57.886 --> 00:00:59.997
Danny: It’s not funny!

11
00:00:59.998 --> 00:01:03.522
Why don’t you stop laughing and help?

12
00:01:03.523 --> 00:01:06.932
Brad: Fine. Why don’t you just make a flashlight?

13
00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:12.554
Danny: Oh right. Good idea.

14
00:01:12.555 --> 00:01:16.078
Tina: Cool! This is a nice, shiny world.

15
00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:22.647
Brad: I’d like to take some of these rocks home.

16
00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:26.870
Tina: That looks like gold over there!

17
00:01:26.871 --> 00:01:28.694
Brad: And look over there!

18
00:01:28.695 --> 00:01:32.721
That rock looks like silver.

19
00:01:32.722 --> 00:01:35.433
Danny: Ow! Don’t bump into me.

20
00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:40.186
Tina: Sorry.

21
00:01:40.187 --> 00:01:42.822
Danny: I thought I saw something there.

22
00:01:42.823 --> 00:01:47.052
Tina: You’re crazy. There’s nothing here but rocks.

23
00:01:47.053 --> 00:01:49.533
Danny: But I was sure I saw . . .

24
00:01:49.534 --> 00:01:53.617
Brad: Let’s keep going.

25
00:01:53.618 --> 00:01:55.053
Danny: What was that?

26
00:01:55.054 --> 00:01:56.509
Tina: What was what?

27
00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.357
Danny: I thought I heard a rock falling.

28
00:01:59.358 --> 00:02:04.412
Brad: It must have been your imagination.

29
00:02:04.413 --> 00:02:07.120
Danny: I definitely heard something.

30
00:02:07.121 --> 00:02:09.235
Brad: I don’t see anything.

31
00:02:09.236 --> 00:02:16.535
Tina: Shine your flashlight everywhere.

32
00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:19.610
Brad: You’re imagining things, Danny.

33
00:02:19.611 --> 00:02:23.651
Danny: It wasn’t my imagination!

34
00:02:23.652 --> 00:02:27.595
Tina: Well, no one else is seeing or hearing things.

35
00:02:27.596 --> 00:02:30.173
Brad: You’re getting spooked by the dark.

36
00:02:30.174 --> 00:02:35.371
Danny: No, I’m not!

37
00:02:35.372 --> 00:02:41.772
Danny: Sorry. I’ll get it.

38
00:02:41.773 --> 00:02:43.915
Brad: This isn’t good.

39
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:46.629
Danny: I think I found it. Oops!

40
00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:48.231
Brad & Tina: What?

41
00:02:48.232 --> 00:02:50.713
Danny: I squashed the flashlight.

42
00:02:50.714 --> 00:02:53.504
Tina: You’ll have to make it again, Danny.

43
00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:56.694
Danny: I don’t know . . . It’s pretty squashed.

44
00:02:56.695 --> 00:02:59.882
Danny: Brad, what are you doing behind me?

45
00:02:59.883 --> 00:03:02.182
Brad: I’m over here.

46
00:03:02.183 --> 00:03:06.904
Danny: And why are you wearing a furry coat?

47
00:03:06.905 --> 00:03:11.706
Brad: I’m not wearing a furry coat . . .

48
00:03:11.707 --> 00:03:17.083
Tina: It’s . . . it’s . . . a . . . m-monster!

49
00:03:17.084 --> 00:03:20.519
All three: Aaaaaahhhh!
